{"resourceType":"Observation","id":"synthetic-unit-window-a","meta":{"profile":["https://fhir.speirotech.net/StructureDefinition/speiro-unit-window-result-observation"]},"text":{"status":"additional","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p>Synthetic source window a. Outcome derives from the source segment status, not an independent per-window verdict. No executed rule version is supplied; no independent rule execution is claimed. Short tails and segment-local indices are preserved. XP does not establish supervision reconciliation; no payment conclusion.</p></div>"},"status":"final","code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://fhir.speirotech.net/CodeSystem/speiro-unit-check-fact","code":"unit-window-result"}]},"subject":{"reference":"Patient/synthetic-subject"},"encounter":{"reference":"Encounter/synthetic-unit-segment-direct"},"effectivePeriod":{"start":"2026-01-01T09:00:00Z","end":"2026-01-01T09:15:00Z"},"valueCodeableConcept":{"coding":[{"system":"https://fhir.speirotech.net/CodeSystem/speiro-unit-outcome","code":"validated"}]},"component":[{"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://fhir.speirotech.net/CodeSystem/speiro-unit-check-fact","code":"unit-index"}]},"valueInteger":1},{"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://fhir.speirotech.net/CodeSystem/speiro-unit-check-fact","code":"service-context"}]},"valueString":"rbt_direct"}]}